# Why you don’t see “topic name” in your command?

In my case:

Storage Account → Event Grid Subscription → Azure Function

so, we are using a system topic, not a custom topic.

there is Two types of Event Grid topics:
1. System Topic: this is use when we configure azure source service like:

Storage Account
Azure Resource Group
Azure subscription
Key Vault, etc.

# in this case:

✔ No topic name needed in your command
✔ Azure automatically creates system topic for Storage Account internally.
✔ You only reference --source-resource-id
✔ Topic management is hidden for system events

2. Custom Topic: Used when YOU publish events yourself.


